<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[P-101 protection interlock. Trips on LSHH-101, discharge pressure high (PSH-101), motor over-temperature (TSH-101) or station ESD. Run enable hardwired to MCC-1 cubicle 1A.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[AOI_PumpInterlock(PUMP_01_IL,Pump_01_Run_Request,LSHH_101,Pump_01_Disch_Press_Hi,Pump_01_Motor_Temp_Hi,ESD_Active,Pump_01_Run_Enable);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[P-101 protective shutdown alarm to HMI alarm summary.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(PUMP_01_IL.Shutdown_Alarm)OTE(Pump_01_Shutdown_Alarm);]]>
